    -
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r_t(a_t)\right] \\
    &\leq
    \max_{a \in [0,1]}
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(a)\right]
    -
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(a_t)\right]
    +
